Package: local.lumid.flatglass
Name: FlatGlass
Version: 1.8.4+roothide.test1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, roothide
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: lumid
Author: lumid
Description: Customize the highlights on your Home Screen icons.
 .
 - **Remove Highlights** rebuilds supported layered icons with a flat finish.
 - **Edge Only** adds a soft highlight around the icon.
 - **Edge and Artwork** highlights the edge and the artwork.
 .
 Choose a mode in **Settings → FlatGlass**. Settings are available in English and Russian. If the Home Screen keeps showing the previous finish, respring to apply the change.
 .
 Native RootHide test build. Requires a tweak injector and PreferenceLoader.
 .
 IconServices hooks and rendering adapted from IconGlare by evgeniy558.
